# cbtrack — experiment data tree (kept LOCAL by default)
# Experiment runs/baselines are local research data: large, often derived from
# the gitignored third_party/ (the authors' results), and reproducible. They are
# NOT committed to the public repo. To opt into a FAIR-in-git record later (per
# docs/cbtrack/adr/0005), un-ignore experiments/registry/ + experiments/runs/**/
# manifest.json and use Git LFS for the large result.json payloads.
experiments/
.cbtrack_test_tmp/

# TypeScript incremental build info
web/*.tsbuildinfo
*.tsbuildinfo
